### ─── Purchase orders and goods receiving ──────────────────────────────────────
### Covers `POST /api/purchase-orders`, `GET /api/purchase-orders`,
### `GET /api/purchase-orders/:id`, `PATCH /api/purchase-orders/:id/submit`,
### and `PATCH /api/purchase-orders/:id/receive`.
###
### All routes require a Bearer access token. Only `ADMIN` and
### `PHARMACIST` can authorise purchase orders and goods receiving.
###
### Purchase-order lifecycle:
###   PENDING  -- submit  -->  ORDERED  -- receive  -->  PARTIAL  -- receive  -->  RECEIVED
###                                                                -- cancel  -->  CANCELLED
###
### Quick start:
###   1. Start the API:  npm start
###   2. Send the "LOGIN as pharmacist" request below.
###   3. Get a supplier id (seeded or POST /api/suppliers once that endpoint is
###      implemented).
###   4. Get a product id (GET /api/products).
###   5. Walk through the create -> submit -> receive flow.

@host = http://localhost
@port = 3000
@base = {{host}}:{{port}}/api


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH — log in as a pharmacist (purchase orders + goods receiving) and a
### cashier (used to demonstrate that the cashier role is rejected).
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name loginPharmacist
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "pharmacist@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ── Login as a Admin ─────────────────────────────────────
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ── Login as a Cashier ─────────────────────────────────────

# @name loginCashier
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "cashier@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ── Store tokens for later requests ─────────────────────────────────────

@pharmToken = {{loginPharmacist.response.body.accessToken}}
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
@cashierToken = {{loginCashier.response.body.accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### DISCOVERY — look up suppliers and product ids to fill the bodies below.
### Replace SUPPLIER_UUID and PRODUCT_UUID with real values.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


GET {{base}}/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. CREATE PURCHASE ORDER — pharmacist drafts a new PO.
###    Status: PENDING. The order is NOT sent to the supplier yet.
###    Expect: 201 with the PO id, supplierId, orderDate, and orderItems[].
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "eb75855b-5e00-4f82-904d-eb315d726869",
  "orderDate": "2026-09-08",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "90ab34af-aee1-4f9e-bddd-dadc7e2299e5",
      "qtyOrdered": 100,
      "unitCost": 8.50
    },
    {
      "productId": "aa7be08b-2038-4666-a1fe-1269abf76160",
      "qtyOrdered": 50,
      "unitCost": 11.00
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. LIST PURCHASE ORDERS — paginated, optional status / supplier filters.
###    Expect: 200 with { data, total, page, pageSize, totalPages }.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/purchase-orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ── Filter by status (PENDING | ORDERED | PARTIAL | RECEIVED | CANCELLED)

GET {{base}}/purchase-orders?status=PENDING&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ── Filter by supplier

GET {{base}}/purchase-orders?supplierId=eb75855b-5e00-4f82-904d-eb315d726869&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. GET PURCHASE ORDER BY ID — full detail with line items.
###    Expect: 200 with supplier, user, orderItems[] (each with orderItemId).
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/purchase-orders/14cfc0cd-8262-45d5-97fc-fc43cb08d734
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. SUBMIT PURCHASE ORDER — PENDING -> ORDERED.
###    The order is now committed to the supplier and ready for receiving.
###    Expect: 200 with status = ORDERED.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/purchase-orders/14cfc0cd-8262-45d5-97fc-fc43cb08d734/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. RECEIVE GOODS — full receipt in one go.
###    The order flips to RECEIVED. Each received line creates a lot (or
###    increments an existing lot with the same product_id + lot_number),
###    bumps the lot's current_qty, and writes an ENTRY inventory_movement
###    plus a LOT_CREATED / STOCK_DEDUCTED_FEFO audit row.
###    Expect: 200 with status = RECEIVED and the freshly created lot ids.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/purchase-orders/14cfc0cd-8262-45d5-97fc-fc43cb08d734/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2026-0001",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-09-08",
  "items": [
    {
      "orderItemId": "28fad171-2dc4-46ad-9dc3-848d721fd53b",
      "qtyReceived": 100,
      "lotNumber": "PAR-2027-C",
      "expiryDate": "2028-06-30",
      "unitCost": 8.50
    },
    {
      "orderItemId": "3dd58240-f5bf-41a9-b535-fa10789770e1",
      "qtyReceived": 50,
      "lotNumber": "IBU-2027-002",
      "expiryDate": "2028-03-20",
      "unitCost": 11.00
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 6. PARTIAL RECEIVE — first shipment covers half the qty.
###    The order flips to PARTIAL. A second receive call (with the remaining
###    qty) flips it to RECEIVED.
###    Expect: 200 with status = PARTIAL.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/purchase-orders/14cfc0cd-8262-45d5-97fc-fc43cb08d734/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2026-0002",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-09-08",
  "items": [
    {
      "orderItemId": "28fad171-2dc4-46ad-9dc3-848d721fd53b",
      "qtyReceived": 50,
      "lotNumber": "PAR-2027-D",
      "expiryDate": "2028-06-30",
      "unitCost": 8.50
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 7. COMPLETE PARTIAL — second shipment clears the remaining qty.
###    Expect: 200 with status = RECEIVED.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/purchase-orders/14cfc0cd-8262-45d5-97fc-fc43cb08d734/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2026-0003",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-09-15",
  "items": [
    {
      "orderItemId": "28fad171-2dc4-46ad-9dc3-848d721fd53b",
      "qtyReceived": 50,
      "lotNumber": "PAR-2027-E",
      "expiryDate": "2028-12-31",
      "unitCost": 8.60
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 8. NEGATIVE — over-receive (qtyReceived > remaining qty).
###    Expect: 400 PO_OVERRECEIPT.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/purchase-orders/14cfc0cd-8262-45d5-97fc-fc43cb08d734/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2026-0004",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-09-15",
  "items": [
    {
      "orderItemId": "14cfc0cd-8262-45d5-97fc-fc43cb08d734",
      "qtyReceived": 9999,
      "lotNumber": "PAR-2027-F",
      "expiryDate": "2028-12-31",
      "unitCost": 8.60
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 9. NEGATIVE — receiving against a PENDING (not yet submitted) PO.
###    Expect: 409 — only ORDERED or PARTIAL orders can be received.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/purchase-orders/14cfc0cd-8262-45d5-97fc-fc43cb08d734/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2026-0005",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-09-15",
  "items": [
    {
      "orderItemId": "28fad171-2dc4-46ad-9dc3-848d721fd53b",
      "qtyReceived": 10,
      "lotNumber": "PAR-2027-G",
      "expiryDate": "2028-12-31",
      "unitCost": 8.60
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 10. NEGATIVE — receiving an unknown orderItemId.
###     Expect: 404.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/purchase-orders/PO_UUID/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2026-0006",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-09-15",
  "items": [
    {
      "orderItemId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "qtyReceived": 1,
      "lotNumber": "PAR-2027-H",
      "expiryDate": "2028-12-31",
      "unitCost": 8.60
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 11. NEGATIVE — missing required field.
###     Expect: 400 from ValidationPipe.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/purchase-orders/PO_UUID/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": []
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 12. NEGATIVE — creating a PO with no items.
###     Expect: 400 from ValidationPipe (items must not be empty).
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "SUPPLIER_UUID",
  "orderDate": "2026-09-08",
  "items": []
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 13. NEGATIVE — unit cost below the 0.01 floor.
###     Expect: 400 from ValidationPipe.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "SUPPLIER_UUID",
  "orderDate": "2026-09-08",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_UUID",
      "qtyOrdered": 10,
      "unitCost": 0
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 14. NEGATIVE — cashier is not allowed to authorise a PO.
###     Expect: 403 from the RolesGuard.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "SUPPLIER_UUID",
  "orderDate": "2026-09-08",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_UUID",
      "qtyOrdered": 10,
      "unitCost": 8.50
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 15. NEGATIVE — get an unknown PO id.
###     Expect: 404.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/purchase-orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 16. POST-RECEIVE CHECK — the lot endpoint should now expose the new lot
###     with current_qty = qtyReceived. Replace LOT_UUID with the value
###     returned by the receive call above.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/lots/335ef432-7f6e-4f86-9373-e6d0e3973ff1
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
